_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Qg6Cd7ntlm5ZgH0FtpKge_LhGNuYuIwL3A_7Y5OqUxA&oe=69D66713"}, {"file_name": "screenshot2.png", "id": "886544650708548", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295512_886544654041881_5858571116903816650_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=urjHPrdbpVAQ7kNvwF-8XwN&_nc_oc=AdoBDzXyWBwAw6edbuZSML5cDU489jab_uGx6eab7yNZd71ZYG5_e38YX5uhysk2mbY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2meU9pehMK90tQCbgLdn7OAWEQMHj5aihkAJ7DS_1msg&oe=69D64994"}, {"file_name": "CW_EA_Trailer_Thumnail_(2560x1440)_013.png", "id": "4535792186735301", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307326_4535792190068634_2307844779775273825_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ANKOFtGyCwwQ7kNvwGabwVQ&_nc_oc=Adq5W2LUXq2nx-9aWOA5FgG-kFe6FlHSQsNC35pIKYJ3QvCAWCvKqOLNjPSXQ7NwO4Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3qyqB-MhuodahmaRYE7V-gKBxHmZ_7JU3ND_m2AOkE8A&oe=69D63A7B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape_v3 copy.png", "id": "1235211045000973", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303864_1235211048334306_7643070682220301624_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XYYeKXBM0dUQ7kNvwFrqMch&_nc_oc=AdqHUfSZPM4zI_ctwXwmkYoA48dXDV-GdNzpmafPVhxAPs8GLLikRQtVspygMPTXWRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1L9IRkB89RDydcKBbnFfKifSJtnkAplFfkO16xaGFXVQ&oe=69D657B2"}, "display_name": "Cozy Worlds", "keywords": ["Sandbox", "Creation", "Cozy", "Garden", "Meditation"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udf0d **Relax, create, and escape into magical worlds.** \n\n\ud83e\udd8c **Shrink down and run or fly through your creations.**\n\n\u2728 **New content every month.**\n\n\"The most relaxing little big game I\u2019ve played for a long time.\u201d_\u2014 Quest Review\n\nCozy Worlds lets you shape magical lands in your home in mixed reality, then dive into VR for deeper immersion when you want to fully check out. It\u2019s a place to relax, enter a creative flow, and disappear for a while into something beautiful.\n\n# Transform the world with magical floating islands.\n{1749114473138071}\nBuild in mixed reality with simple hand movements and watch your space come alive with beautiful worlds.\n\n# Then become tiny and RUN or FLY inside what you made.\n{1298619772163611}\nSwitch from cozy creation to playful exploration. Explore your creation from within at miniature scale and see your world from a whole new perspective.\n\n# Discover what Cozy Worlds has to offer\n- Unlock a growing Creative Library from ancient fortresses to delicate flowers, with more added over time.\n- Paint and erase terrain, place living elements, and craft your world with simple, satisfying controls.\n- Become tiny and explore what you create to experience your creations at a whole new scale.\n- Choose the mode that fits your mood: Journey through World Builder or enter Creative Mode for unrestricted freedom.\n\n**About Early Access:** Cozy Worlds is growing with new journeys, design elements, and animal friends in future updates. Join early and help shape what comes next.\n\nJoin the Cozy Community on our Discord: discord.gg/fbAvagsC8r", "short_description": "Create magical floating worlds in mixed reality, then shrink down and run or fly through them in VR. Cozy Worlds is a calming worldbuilder where you sculpt terrain, unlock beautiful plants, ruins, and creatures, and escape into a peaceful creative flow. New content arrives regularly!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vrtogether.us/cozy-worlds-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRTogether", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.vrtogether.us/cozyworlds", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topic